Major Shareholders
The largest shareholders are primarily institutional investors, holding around 69% of shares. The top holders as of late 2025 include: 
The Vanguard Group, Inc.
BlackRock, Inc.
FMR, LLC (Fidelity)
State Street Corporation
JPMorgan Chase & Co. 
CEO Jensen Huang remains the largest individual shareholder, with a significant stake in the company. 
For the most up-to-date information on governance, the official source is the NVIDIA Investor Relations website. 